{"id":"243e4a6577a71cc8","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion3 Decidable Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set — ZFC Recursion3 Decidable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set — ZFC Recursion3 Decidable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set — ZFC Recursion3 Decidable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0e39684c33d074c\" href=\"?note=d0e39684c33d074c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate\">58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function\">58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (set-coded characteristic function of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\\)</span> (total-recursive-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function\">58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land(f(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land(f(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The recursive-function witness is the set-coded graph accepted by the upstream predicate, with its range explicitly restricted to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"d0e39684c33d074c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S$ (total-recursive-function predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land(f(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"189177d39c46a492","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba4c98699a906790","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3245","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md|58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set]]（batch12）